{
  "type": "USJ",
  "version": "3.0",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "book",
      "marker": "id",
      "code": "JUD",
      "content": [
        "Autogenerated BSB by bsb2usfm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "h",
      "content": [
        "Jude"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "toc1",
      "content": [
        "Jude"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "toc2",
      "content": [
        "Jude"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "toc3",
      "content": [
        "JUD"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "mt1",
      "content": [
        "Jude"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "1",
      "sid": "JUD 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "A Greeting from Jude"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "JAS 1:1",
          "content": [
            "James 1:1"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "JUD 1:1"
        },
        "Jude, a servant of Jesus Christ and a brother of James,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "To those who ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "are"
          ]
        },
        " called, loved by God ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Father, and kept in Jesus Christ:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "JUD 1:2"
        },
        "Mercy, peace, and love be multiplied to you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "God’s Judgment on the Ungodly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "2PE 3:1-7",
          "content": [
            "2 Peter 3:1–7"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "JUD 1:3"
        },
        "Beloved, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "although"
          ]
        },
        " I made every effort to write to you about the salvation we share, I felt it necessary to write ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " urge you to contend earnestly for the faith entrusted once for all to the saints. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "JUD 1:4"
        },
        "For certain men have crept in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "among you"
          ]
        },
        " unnoticed — ungodly ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "ones"
          ]
        },
        " who were designated long ago for condemnation. They turn the grace of our God into a license for immorality, and they deny our only Master and Lord, Jesus Christ."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "JUD 1:5"
        },
        "Although you are fully aware of this, I want to remind you that after Jesus",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:5 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "NE, WH, BYZ, and TR "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "the Lord"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " had delivered ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "His"
          ]
        },
        " people out of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " land of Egypt, He destroyed those who did not believe. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "JUD 1:6"
        },
        "And ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " angels who did not stay within their ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "own"
          ]
        },
        " domain but abandoned their ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "proper"
          ]
        },
        " dwelling— ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "these"
          ]
        },
        " He has kept in eternal chains under darkness, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "bound"
          ]
        },
        " for judgment on ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "that"
          ]
        },
        " great day. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "JUD 1:7"
        },
        "In like manner, Sodom and Gomorrah and the cities around them, who indulged in sexual immorality and pursued strange flesh, are on display as an example of those who sustain ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " punishment of eternal fire."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "JUD 1:8"
        },
        "Yet in the same way these dreamers defile ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their"
          ]
        },
        " bodies, reject authority, and slander glorious ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "beings"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "JUD 1:9"
        },
        "But ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "even"
          ]
        },
        " the archangel Michael, when he disputed with the devil over the body of Moses, did not presume to bring a slanderous charge ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "against him"
          ]
        },
        ", but said, “",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "The"
          ]
        },
        " Lord rebuke you!”",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:9 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "This account is attributed by Origen to the Testament of Moses, also called the Assumption of Moses."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "JUD 1:10"
        },
        "These ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "men"
          ]
        },
        ", however, slander what they do not understand, and like irrational animals, they will be destroyed by the things they do instinctively. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "JUD 1:11"
        },
        "Woe to them! They have traveled the path of Cain; they have rushed for profit into the error of Balaam; they have perished in Korah’s rebellion."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "JUD 1:12"
        },
        "These ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "men"
          ]
        },
        " are hidden reefs",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:12 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "are blemishes"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " in your love feasts, shamelessly feasting ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "with you"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " shepherding ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "only"
          ]
        },
        " themselves. ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "They are"
          ]
        },
        " clouds without water, carried along by ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " wind; fruitless trees in autumn, twice dead after being uprooted. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "JUD 1:13"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "They are"
          ]
        },
        " wild waves of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " sea, foaming up their ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "own"
          ]
        },
        " shame; wandering stars, for whom blackest darkness has been reserved forever."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "JUD 1:14"
        },
        "Enoch, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " seventh from Adam, also prophesied about them:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "b"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q1",
      "content": [
        "“Behold, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Lord is coming"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        "with myriads of His holy ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "ones"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "JUD 1:15"
        },
        "to execute judgment on everyone,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q1",
      "content": [
        "and to convict all the ungodly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        "of every ungodly act of wickedness"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        "and every harsh ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "word"
          ]
        },
        " spoken against Him by ungodly sinners.”",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:15 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "See the First Book of Enoch (",
                {
                  "type": "ref",
                  "loc": "1:9",
                  "content": [
                    "1 Enoch 1:9"
                  ]
                },
                ")."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "JUD 1:16"
        },
        "These ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "men"
          ]
        },
        " are discontented grumblers, following after ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their"
          ]
        },
        " own lusts; their mouths spew arrogance; they flatter others for their own advantage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "A Call to Persevere"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "HEB 10:19-39",
          "content": [
            "Hebrews 10:19–39"
          ]
        },
        "; ",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "2PE 3:1-7",
          "content": [
            "2 Peter 3:1–7"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "JUD 1:17"
        },
        "But you, beloved, remember what was foretold by the apostles of our Lord Jesus Christ ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "JUD 1:18"
        },
        "when they said to you, “In ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " last times there will be scoffers who will follow after their own ungodly desires.”",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:18 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "See ",
                {
                  "type": "ref",
                  "loc": "2PE 3:3",
                  "content": [
                    "2 Peter 3:3"
                  ]
                },
                "."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "19",
          "sid": "JUD 1:19"
        },
        "These are the ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "ones who"
          ]
        },
        " cause divisions, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "who are"
          ]
        },
        " worldly ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " devoid of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Spirit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "20",
          "sid": "JUD 1:20"
        },
        "But you, beloved, by building yourselves ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "up"
          ]
        },
        " in your most holy faith ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " praying in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Holy Spirit, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "21",
          "sid": "JUD 1:21"
        },
        "keep yourselves in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " love of God as you await the mercy of our Lord Jesus Christ to bring ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "you"
          ]
        },
        " eternal life."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "22",
          "sid": "JUD 1:22"
        },
        "And indeed, have mercy on those who doubt; ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "23",
          "sid": "JUD 1:23"
        },
        "save others by snatching ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "them"
          ]
        },
        " from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " fire; and to still others show mercy ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "tempered "
          ]
        },
        " with fear, hating even the clothing stained by the flesh."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Doxology"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "ROM 16:25-27",
          "content": [
            "Romans 16:25–27"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "24",
          "sid": "JUD 1:24"
        },
        "Now to Him who is able to keep you from stumbling and to present ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "you"
          ]
        },
        " unblemished in His glorious presence, with great joy — ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "25",
          "sid": "JUD 1:25"
        },
        "to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " only God our Savior ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "be"
          ]
        },
        " glory, majesty, dominion, and authority through Jesus Christ our Lord before all time, and now, and for all eternity."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "Amen."
      ]
    }
  ]
}